{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1117","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G. Recursive Queries"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a permutation $$$p_1, p_2, \\dots, p_n$$$. You should answer $$$q$$$ queries. Each query is a pair $$$(l_i, r_i)$$$, and you should calculate $$$f(l_i, r_i)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's denote $$$m_{l, r}$$$ as the position of the maximum in subsegment $$$p_l, p_{l+1}, \\dots, p_r$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then $$$f(l, r) = (r - l + 1) + f(l, m_{l,r} - 1) + f(m_{l,r} + 1, r)$$$ if $$$l \\le r$$$ or $$$0$$$ otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^6$$$, $$$1 \\le q \\le 10^6$$$) — the size of the permutation $$$p$$$ and the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ pairwise distinct integers $$$p_1, p_2, \\dots, p_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le p_i \\le n$$$, $$$p_i \\neq p_j$$$ for $$$i \\neq j$$$) — permutation $$$p$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains $$$q$$$ integers $$$l_1, l_2, \\dots, l_q$$$ — the first parts of the queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The fourth line contains $$$q$$$ integers $$$r_1, r_2, \\dots, r_q$$$ — the second parts of the queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It's guaranteed that $$$1 \\le l_i \\le r_i \\le n$$$ for all queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print $$$q$$$ integers — the values $$$f(l_i, r_i)$$$ for the corresponding queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4 5\n3 1 4 2\n2 1 1 2 1\n2 3 4 4 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1 6 8 5 1 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Description of the queries: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(2, 2) = (2 - 2 + 1) + f(2, 1) + f(3, 2) = 1 + 0 + 0 = 1$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1, 3) = (3 - 1 + 1) + f(1, 2) + f(4, 3) = 3 + (2 - 1 + 1) + f(1, 0) + f(2, 2) = 3 + 2 + (2 - 2 + 1) = 6$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1, 4) = (4 - 1 + 1) + f(1, 2) + f(4, 4) = 4 + 3 + 1 = 8$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(2, 4) = (4 - 2 + 1) + f(2, 2) + f(4, 4) = 3 + 1 + 1 = 5$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1, 1) = (1 - 1 + 1) + 0 + 0 = 1$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"G","problemCode":"1117G","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1117/problem/G"}